    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "登录可靠性 · 失败分类（5m，已分流噪音）",
      "description": "登录失败按 error 维度分解（LOGIN_ERROR / IDENTITY_PROVIDER_LOGIN_ERROR / IDENTITY_PROVIDER_FIRST_LOGIN_ERROR）。已排除噪音：本机 silent-check-sso 的 invalid_redirect_uri（72h 实测 55 条）、密码/用户不存在（user_not_found 42 条、invalid_user_credentials 5 条）与 security-admin-console 管理台（17 条）。分类法与实测口径见 docs/auth/web-qq-diagnostics.md。查询已对生产 Loki 实测验证（LogQL 用反引号字符串；修复前版本用了非法的单引号）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "expr": "sum by (error) (count_over_time({container_name=\"keycloak\"} |~ `type=\"(LOGIN_ERROR|IDENTITY_PROVIDER_LOGIN_ERROR|IDENTITY_PROVIDER_FIRST_LOGIN_ERROR)\"` !~ \"security-admin-console\" | regexp `error=\"(?P<error>[^\"]+)\"` | error!~ \"invalid_redirect_uri|user_not_found|invalid_user_credentials\" [5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "登录可靠性 · broker 会话连续性（5m，P0 信号）",
      "description": "Web QQ 登录 P0 的两个连续性信号：cookie_not_found（broker 回调读不到 auth session cookie）与 Failed to verify login action（first-broker-login 表单校验失败）。正常用户路径不应出现；持续非零即按 docs/auth/web-qq-diagnostics.md §3 取证。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 30
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({container_name=\"keycloak\"} |~ \"cookie_not_found\" [5m]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "range",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({container_name=\"keycloak\"} |~ \"Failed to verify login action\" [5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "IdP 失败分解（provider × error，5m）",
      "description": "按 identity_provider 与 error 分解 broker 失败，定位 QQ / WG 单点故障。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 39
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "expr": "sum by (identity_provider, error) (count_over_time({container_name=\"keycloak\"} |~ `type=\"(LOGIN_ERROR|IDENTITY_PROVIDER_LOGIN_ERROR|IDENTITY_PROVIDER_FIRST_LOGIN_ERROR)\"` | regexp `(identityProvider=\"(?P<identity_provider>[^\"]*)\")?.*error=\"(?P<error>[^\"]+)\"` | error!~ \"invalid_redirect_uri|user_not_found|invalid_user_credentials\" [5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "broker 回调（UA / 状态码，query 与凭据已脱敏）",
      "description": "Caddy 对 /realms/*/broker/* 的受控访问日志：query 里的 code/state/session_state/iss 与 Cookie/Authorization 头在写 stdout 前已被 filter 删除。用于区分真实用户与扫描器、识别移动 QQ 内置浏览器 / WebView。见 docs/auth/web-qq-diagnostics.md §3.4。",
      "datasource": {
